<!-- pages/winter/review.wxml - 审核中心：待审（入队申请 + 打卡） / 已审（组内打卡记录） -->
<view class="winter-page">
  <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="notice-bar" wx:if="{{noPerm}}">{{errMsg || '加载失败'}}</view>

    <block wx:if="{{!noPerm}}">
      <!-- 两个 sheet：待审（队长/教练）/ 已审（全员） -->
      <view class="chip-row" style="margin-bottom:24rpx">
        <text wx:if="{{canReview}}" class="chip {{tab === 'pending' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-v="pending" bindtap="onTab">待审 {{list.length}}</text>
        <text class="chip {{tab === 'reviewed' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-v="reviewed" bindtap="onTab">已审 {{reviewed.length}}</text>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{canReview}}" class="notice-bar" style="margin-bottom:20rpx">
        👤 我的角色：{{roleText}} · 队长/教练打卡自动通过，无需审核
      </view>

      <!-- ============ 待审 ============ -->
      <block wx:if="{{tab === 'pending'}}">
        <!-- 待审入队申请（仅队长） -->
        <view class="card" wx:if="{{applies.length > 0}}">
          <text class="card-title">待审入队（{{applies.length}} 人）</text>
          <text class="card-sub">缴费由你线下收款后自行标记，不阻塞审批</text>
          <view class="apply-item" wx:for="{{applies}}" wx:key="userId">
            <view class="member-row" style="border-bottom:none">
              <image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" class="member-avatar" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
              <view wx:else class="member-avatar avatar-fallback">{{item.avatarInitial || '?'}}</view>
              <view class="member-info">
                <text class="member-name">{{item.nickName}} <text class="tag tag-gray">{{item.roleText}}</text></text>
                <text class="member-meta">近期成绩 {{item.recentResult || '未填'}} · 目标 {{item.target || '未填'}}</text>
              </view>
              <text class="tag {{item.feeStatus === 'paid' ? 'tag-green' : (item.feeStatus === 'free' ? 'tag-blue' : 'tag-orange')}}">{{item.feeStatus === 'paid' ? '已缴费' : (item.feeStatus === 'free' ? '免费' : '未缴费')}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="card-sub" wx:if="{{item.reason}}">申请理由：{{item.reason}}</text>
            <view class="mini-btn-row">
              <text class="mini-btn mini-ghost" data-uid="{{item.userId}}" data-fee="{{item.feeStatus}}" bindtap="onToggleFee">{{item.feeStatus === 'paid' ? '改免费' : (item.feeStatus === 'free' ? '改未缴' : '标记已缴')}}</text>
              <text class="mini-btn mini-ghost" data-uid="{{item.userId}}" data-pass="{{false}}" bindtap="onApplyReview">驳回</text>
              <text class="mini-btn" data-uid="{{item.userId}}" data-pass="{{true}}" bindtap="onApplyReview">通过</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <!-- 待审请假（队长/教练） -->
        <view class="card" wx:if="{{leaves.length > 0}}">
          <text class="card-title">待审请假（{{leaves.length}}）</text>
          <text class="card-sub">通过后该周不考核：不计完成率、不计罚金</text>
          <view class="apply-item" wx:for="{{leaves}}" wx:key="_id">
            <view class="member-row" style="border-bottom:none">
              <image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" class="member-avatar" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
              <view wx:else class="member-avatar avatar-fallback">{{item.avatarInitial || '?'}}</view>
              <view class="member-info">
                <text class="member-name">{{item.nickName}}</text>
                <text class="member-meta">{{item.startDate}} ~ {{item.endDate}} · {{item.days}} 天 · {{item.typeText || '其他'}}</text>
              </view>
            </view>
            <text class="card-sub" wx:if="{{item.reason}}">原因：{{item.reason}}</text>
            <view class="mini-btn-row">
              <text class="mini-btn mini-ghost" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="onRejectLeave">驳回</text>
              <text class="mini-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="onPassLeave">通过</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <!-- 待审打卡：点击卡片展开详情（含打卡图片） -->
        <view class="card record-card" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="_id" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-key="list" bindtap="onToggle">
          <view class="member-row" style="border-bottom:none">
            <image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" class="member-avatar" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="onAvatarError" data-key="list" data-i="{{index}}" />
            <view wx:else class="member-avatar avatar-fallback">{{item.avatarInitial || '?'}}</view>
            <view class="member-info">
              <text class="member-name">{{item.nickName}}</text>
              <text class="member-meta">{{item.date}} · {{item.distance > 0 ? (item.distance + ' 公里') : ''}}{{item.duration > 0 ? (' ' + item.duration + ' 分钟') : ''}}</text>
            </view>
            <view class="member-right">
              <text class="tag tag-orange">待审核</text>
              <text class="expand-hint">{{expandedId === item._id ? '收起 ▲' : '详情 ▼'}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>

          <view class="record-detail" wx:if="{{expandedId === item._id}}">
            <view class="photo-row" wx:if="{{item.tempImages.length}}">
              <image wx:for="{{item.tempImages}}" wx:for-item="u" wx:key="*this" class="img-preview" src="{{u}}" mode="aspectFill" data-key="list" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-url="{{u}}" catchtap="onPreview" />
            </view>
            <text wx:else class="card-sub">（该打卡没有上传图片）</text>

            <view class="detail-rows">
              <text class="detail-row">📅 日期：{{item.date}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row">🏃 跑量：{{item.distance > 0 ? (item.distance + ' 公里') : '—'}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row">⏱ 时长：{{item.duration > 0 ? (item.duration + ' 分钟') : '—'}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row" wx:if="{{item.note}}">📝 备注：{{item.note}}</text>
            </view>

            <view class="record-actions" catchtap="noop">
              <button class="btn btn-ghost" style="flex:1;margin-right:12rpx" loading="{{busyId === item._id}}" bindtap="onAskReject" data-id="{{item._id}}">驳回</button>
              <button class="btn" style="flex:1" loading="{{busyId === item._id}}" bindtap="onPass" data-id="{{item._id}}">通过</button>
            </view>
            <view wx:if="{{reasonId === item._id}}" catchtap="noop" style="margin-top:16rpx">
              <textarea class="textarea" placeholder="请填写驳回原因" value="{{reason}}" bindinput="onReasonInput"></textarea>
              <view style="display:flex;margin-top:12rpx">
                <button class="btn btn-gray" style="flex:1;margin-right:12rpx" bindtap="onCancelReject">取消</button>
                <button class="btn" style="flex:1" bindtap="onConfirmReject" data-id="{{item._id}}">确认驳回</button>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="empty" wx:if="{{list.length === 0 && applies.length === 0}}">🎉 暂无待审事项</view>
      </block>

      <!-- ============ 已审（组内打卡记录） ============ -->
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="card record-card" wx:for="{{reviewed}}" wx:key="_id" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-key="reviewed" bindtap="onToggle">
          <view class="member-row" style="border-bottom:none">
            <image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" class="member-avatar" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="onAvatarError" data-key="reviewed" data-i="{{index}}" />
            <view wx:else class="member-avatar avatar-fallback">{{item.avatarInitial || '?'}}</view>
            <view class="member-info">
              <text class="member-name">{{item.nickName}}</text>
              <text class="member-meta">{{item.date}} · {{item.distance > 0 ? (item.distance + ' 公里') : ''}}{{item.duration > 0 ? (' ' + item.duration + ' 分钟') : ''}}</text>
            </view>
            <view class="member-right">
              <text class="tag {{item.status === 'approved' ? 'tag-green' : 'tag-red'}}">{{item.status === 'approved' ? '已通过' : '已驳回'}}</text>
              <text class="expand-hint">{{expandedId === item._id ? '收起 ▲' : '详情 ▼'}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>

          <view class="record-detail" wx:if="{{expandedId === item._id}}">
            <view class="photo-row" wx:if="{{item.tempImages.length}}">
              <image wx:for="{{item.tempImages}}" wx:for-item="u" wx:key="*this" class="img-preview" src="{{u}}" mode="aspectFill" data-key="reviewed" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-url="{{u}}" catchtap="onPreview" />
            </view>
            <text wx:else class="card-sub">（该打卡没有上传图片）</text>
            <view class="detail-rows">
              <text class="detail-row">📅 日期：{{item.date}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row">🏃 跑量：{{item.distance > 0 ? (item.distance + ' 公里') : '—'}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row">⏱ 时长：{{item.duration > 0 ? (item.duration + ' 分钟') : '—'}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row" wx:if="{{item.note}}">📝 备注：{{item.note}}</text>
              <text class="detail-row" wx:if="{{item.reviewNote}}">🧾 审核：{{item.reviewNote}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="empty" wx:if="{{reviewed.length === 0}}">本周还没有已审的打卡</view>
      </block>
    </block>
  </block>
</view>
